# Component spec deterministic property order

Canonical implementation: `tooling/scripts/ds-sort-spec.mjs`.

Run:

```bash
npm run ds:sort-spec -- --all
npm run ds:sort-spec -- --check
```

Canonical group mapping and field order are machine-readable in:

- `tooling/lib/property-type-map.json` (type -> ordering group)
- `tooling/scripts/lib/spec-property-types.mjs` (`PROPERTY_FIELD_ORDER`)

Determinism contract:

- Group order, intra-group fallback order, and key order must be stable across repeated runs with unchanged inputs.
- Duplicate property names are invalid.
- Validation emits `DET01` on violations (see `error-codes.mdc`).
